# MandiMitra 🌾

## Project Overview
MandiMitra helps farmers compare crop prices at different mandis and estimate their returns after transportation costs.

## Problem Statement
Farmers may not know which mandi offers the best return after travel expenses.

## Our Solution
Our application compares two mandis and recommends the option with the higher estimated net return based on user-entered prices and costs.

## Features
Mandi Mitra is a mobile-first ledger application designed for verified agricultural crop trading in Maharashtra. It bridges the gap between Farmers, Agricultural Experts (Graders), and Traders by ensuring transparent grading, guaranteed floor pricing, and secure escrow-backed trade workflows.

👥 User Roles & Workflow
The platform supports three distinct roles, each with specific workflows:

Farmer:

My Lots: View existing crop lots, track their status (pending audit vs. certified), and see SMS/WhatsApp notifications regarding expert grades.

Add a Lot: Submit new crop quantities (Wheat, Soybean, Maize, Onion, Tur, Gram), varieties, harvest dates, and storage locations. New lots are initially hidden from the marketplace until certified.

Deliveries: Track accepted deals, route weather updates, and escrow fund releases.

Expert (Auditor):

Audit Queue: Review pending lots and input quality measurements (moisture %, foreign matter %, grain size, color, pest damage). The system automatically assigns a grade (A to D) and calculates price bands.

Certified Lots: View all successfully graded lots.

Feature: Includes a toggle to simulate a market feed outage, falling back on 3-year seasonal baselines.

Trader:

Market: Browse certified lots filtered by crop, grade, minimum quantity, and radius distance from their base location.

AI Bargain Broker: Engage with an automated negotiation system where bids are evaluated against live market bands (Accept, Counter-offer, or Reject).

My Deals & Payments: Manage secure transactions, 10% deposits held in escrow, B2B credit lines, UPI IDs, and APMC eNAM ledgers.

⚙️ Technical Highlights
Interactive UI/UX: Responsive mobile-first layout with dark/light mode support, dynamic forms, and modal sheets.

Geospatial & Route Telemetry: Calculates distances using the Haversine formula and flags live route hazards (e.g., heavy rain, road blockages) affecting delivery fleets.

Secure Financial Handshakes: Implements mock HMAC cryptographic signatures for UPI verification, escrow locks, and credit line ledgers.


